{"created_utc": "2026-11-14T17:13:34.352703+00:00", "engines": [{"binary": "/Users/germar/workspace/geistlib-campaigns/444/metal/bin/mac-omp/release/tests/bench_perf_sweep", "binary_sha256": "9029bad21300e921c99af22459f925011d50a36c9489186297187e619f63b9c3", "commit": "6642260d55a1d5ee71c85548b55ae277e6146228", "kind": "geist", "label": "geist", "linked_libraries": ["/Users/germar/workspace/geistlib-campaigns/444/metal/bin/mac-omp/release/tests/bench_perf_sweep:", "\t/System/Library/Frameworks/Accelerate.framework/Versions/A/Accelerate (compatibility version 1.0.0, current version 4.0.0)", "\t/opt/homebrew/opt/libomp/lib/libomp.dylib (compatibility version 5.0.0, current version 5.0.0)", "\t/usr/lib/libSystem.B.dylib (compatibility version 1.0.0, current version 1359.40.3)"]}, {"binary": "/Users/germar/llama.cpp-cross-engine-PrismML-Eng_llama.cpp/build-metal/bin/llama-bench", "binary_sha256": "140cbb1ce17a79b80df4e0d089b1d1fa79b0cb9cb94b988d8f0310dd943ca9f7", "commit": "adfffbe41b2cabcd51fff326ab045662265062bb", "kind": "llama", "label": "llama.cpp", "linked_libraries": ["/Users/germar/llama.cpp-cross-engine-PrismML-Eng_llama.cpp/build-metal/bin/llama-bench:", "\t@rpath/libllama-bench-impl.dylib (compatibility version 0.0.0, current version 0.0.0)", "\t@rpath/libllama-common.0.dylib (compatibility version 0.0.0, current version 0.0.0)", "\t@rpath/libllama.0.dylib (compatibility version 0.0.0, current version 0.0.0)", "\t@rpath/libggml.0.dylib (compatibility version 0.0.0, current version 0.21.0)", "\t@rpath/libggml-cpu.0.dylib (compatibility version 0.0.0, current version 0.21.0)", "\t@rpath/libggml-blas.0.dylib (compatibility version 0.0.0, current version 0.21.0)", "\t@rpath/libggml-metal.0.dylib (compatibility version 0.0.0, current version 0.21.0)", "\t@rpath/libggml-base.0.dylib (compatibility version 0.0.0, current version 0.21.0)", "\t/usr/lib/libc++.1.dylib (compatibility version 1.0.0, current version 2200.27.0)", "\t/usr/lib/libSystem.B.dylib (compatibility version 1.0.0, current version 1359.0.0)"]}], "host_gate": {"apple_power_gate": true, "apple_temp_gate": {"fallback_seconds": 45, "max_gpu_c": 55}, "cool_each_repeat": true, "cool_each_repeat_note": "One engine call per sequence length and repeat, each after the temperature gate (#444). Measured 2026-11-12 (macmon, geist, gemma4-e2b-q4km): the twelve measurements of one back-to-back call are about 11 s of GPU load and take the chip from its start temperature to 75-82 C; the clock leaves 1293 MHz at 78-81 C. Twelve 512-token repeats in one call from 55 C: nine at 1559-1571 tok/s, then 1092, 1057, 994 with the clock at 907-1144 MHz. One call per repeat: 1560-1567 tok/s in 13 of 14 calls. The night cells of 2026-11-10/-12 failed the 5 % spread gate on this in 12 of 12 tries.", "cooldown_seconds": 60, "max_load_per_core": 0.2, "max_repeat_spread_pct": 5, "max_retries": 3, "min_cpu_idle_pct": 80, "note": "TBD", "settle_seconds": 30, "temp_gate": {"max_millic": 62000, "note": "same gate as the CPU protocol: GPU campaigns on passively cooled hosts throttle too. Hosts without the sensor path skip this gate.", "sensor": "/sys/class/thermal/thermal_zone0/temp"}, "timeout_seconds": 1200}, "host_profile": "apple_m1max_metal", "kind": "metadata", "model": {"file": "Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-PQ2_0.gguf", "key": "bonsai2-27b-pq2", "path": "/Users/germar/geist-models/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-PQ2_0.gguf", "sha256": "3907dc1658db1f78a9826bf8d5bcb8dc65db0d466388937af57f2294fae62ec1"}, "protocol": {"host_gate": {"cooldown_seconds": 60, "max_load_per_core": 0.2, "settle_seconds": 30, "temp_gate": {"max_millic": 62000, "note": "same gate as the CPU protocol: GPU campaigns on passively cooled hosts throttle too. Hosts without the sensor path skip this gate.", "sensor": "/sys/class/thermal/thermal_zone0/temp"}, "timeout_seconds": 14400}, "host_profiles": {"apple_m1max_metal": {"decode_threads": 4, "expect_backend": "metal", "expect_llama_backend": "MTL", "host_gate": {"apple_power_gate": true, "apple_temp_gate": {"fallback_seconds": 45, "max_gpu_c": 65, "note": "Every run starts on a cool GPU (#17, benchmark/METHODOLOGY.md#cool-start-on-apple-silicon): the GPU holds 1293 MHz only up to ~78-83 C, so back to back the engine that runs second, or loads faster, measures throttling (4-7 % in prefill). Checked after the idle gate and its cooldown, right before the run. Measured on the M1 Max (2026-10-21, macmon): idle under the lock the chip settles at GPU 49-55 C, CPU 50-55 C; Metal prefill takes the GPU from 49 to 76 C in 7 s, the clock leaves 1293 MHz at 78-83 C and the GPU reaches 96 C after 90 s; from there it is back below 65 C in about 40 s and below 60 C in about 75 s (CPU alike). 65 C is reached from the hottest state within a minute and lies 10-15 C above the idle floor, so a shared desktop can reach it. Without macmon (not on PATH, /opt/homebrew/bin or /usr/local/bin) the gate pauses 45 s instead, which cooled both engines to parity in #17, and records cool_gate=time."}, "cool_each_repeat": true, "cool_each_repeat_note": "One engine call per sequence length and repeat, each after the temperature gate (#444). Measured 2026-11-12 (macmon, geist, gemma4-e2b-q4km): the twelve measurements of one back-to-back call are about 11 s of GPU load and take the chip from its start temperature to 75-82 C; the clock leaves 1293 MHz at 78-81 C. Twelve 512-token repeats in one call from 55 C: nine at 1559-1571 tok/s, then 1092, 1057, 994 with the clock at 907-1144 MHz. One call per repeat: 1560-1567 tok/s in 13 of 14 calls. The night cells of 2026-11-10/-12 failed the 5 % spread gate on this in 12 of 12 tries.", "max_repeat_spread_pct": 5, "max_retries": 3, "min_cpu_idle_pct": 80, "note": "Replaces the load-average test on this host (bench_cross_engine.py host_is_quiet): macOS on an interactive desktop shared with agents never shows a load average near 0.2/core (2026-10-12: 4-8 at 73 % idle), so the frozen gate waited out Gitea's 3 h job limit without one measurement. The host is quiet when >= 80 % of all cores stayed idle over the settle window; the other agents' benchmarks are excluded by ~/bin/with-mac-lock. A run whose repeats spread by more than 5 % (prefill or decode, any length) is discarded and measured again, up to 3 times: the gate before a run cannot see work that starts during it. A cell waits at most 20 min for a quiet host and then fails as busy: Gitea hands the macOS runner its jobs in ID order, so a nightly cell waiting 2 h per cycle on a desktop in use held every macOS CI check behind it for a day (2026-10-13).", "timeout_seconds": 1200}, "model_host_gate": {"bonsai2-27b-pq2": {"apple_temp_gate": {"fallback_seconds": 45, "max_gpu_c": 55}, "note": "TBD"}}, "note": "M1 Max 32-core GPU, unified memory. Same host as apple_m1max in the CPU protocol; the GPU cell and the CPU cell describe the same machine under two backends. Thread counts are dispatch-side only.", "prefill_threads": 4}, "apple_m6_mini_metal": {"decode_threads": 4, "expect_backend": "metal", "expect_llama_backend": "MTL", "host_gate": {"apple_power_gate": true, "apple_temp_gate": {"fallback_seconds": 45, "max_gpu_c": 65, "note": "Threshold and fallback taken over from the M1 Max profile (65 C, 45 s); not yet measured on the M6."}, "max_repeat_spread_pct": 5, "max_retries": 3, "min_cpu_idle_pct": 80, "note": "As the M1 Max profile: >= 80 % of all cores idle over the settle window, repeats within 5 %, at most 20 min of waiting. A dedicated CI host (runner macmini-m6): other measurements are excluded by ~/bin/with-macmini-lock, and the runner hooks hold that lock for every job.", "timeout_seconds": 1200}, "note": "Apple M6 GPU (Metal 4), unified memory, 32 GB. Same host as apple_m6_mini in the CPU protocol. Thread counts are dispatch-side only.", "prefill_threads": 4}, "nvidia_2080ti_vulkan": {"decode_threads": 4, "expect_backend": "vulkan", "expect_llama_backend": "Vulkan", "note": "RTX 2080 Ti 11 GB (Turing) in the 9950X box; same host as amd_9950x in the CPU protocol, different backend column. The host also enumerates a Raphael iGPU \u2014 runs must set GGML_VK_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 so llama.cpp binds the discrete device; geist's vk_pick_device prefers discrete on its own. Thread counts are dispatch-side only, matching apple_m1max_metal.", "prefill_threads": 4}}, "models": {"bitnet-large-tq2": {"file": "bitnet_b1_58-large-TQ2_0.gguf", "sha256": "281aafb18a9f4a3124c10a1d8683e2296f0cfe8a2944da0a5667d17488a951bb"}, "bonsai2-27b-pq2": {"file": "Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-PQ2_0.gguf", "sha256": "3907dc1658db1f78a9826bf8d5bcb8dc65db0d466388937af57f2294fae62ec1"}, "gemma4-e2b-q4km": {"file": "gemma4-e2b-Q4_K_M.gguf", "sha256": "740185b21d22ceb83a11c3aa62ad5842ef32c70f6096d756bbee85a1e4ec34b8"}, "gemma4-e4b-q4km": {"file": "gemma4-e4b-Q4_K_M.gguf", "sha256": "85a896a047553e842f25297ee5b031d64ff30147d9c4af17b1e4b394cd1fab87"}, "llama32-3b-q4km": {"file": "llama-3.2-3b-Q4_K_M.gguf", "sha256": "6c1a2b41161032677be168d354123594c0e6e67d2b9227c84f296ad037c728ff"}, "qwen3-0.6b-q8": {"file": "qwen3-0.6b-q8_0.gguf", "sha256": "9465e63a22add5354d9bb4b99e90117043c7124007664907259bd16d043bb031"}, "qwen35-0.8b-q8": {"file": "qwen3.5-0.8b-q8_0.gguf", "sha256": "0ad885ffd4bb022fc4f0d33a3308fa108ef8613159d3b3a67e23abca056b7a6c"}, "qwen35-4b-q4": {"file": "qwen3.5-4b-q4_0.gguf", "sha256": "298fcb5fe7a77ccc79745ae24751560c5ac56874caff4bb39b1f2055bd72b8bb"}, "qwen38-27b-q4": {"file": "qwen3.8-27b-q4_0.gguf", "sha256": "ede16c7b36e578ca87a8c70e011e4b4633a32c831c0ce76d0f474582384e671d"}}, "schema": "geist.benchmark.cross-engine-gpu.v2", "workload": {"affinity": "thread-count-only; operating-system scheduled for both engines", "aggregation": "median", "backend": "gpu", "cycles": 4, "decode_n": 64, "dispersion": "median_absolute_deviation", "gpu_offload_layers": 99, "kv_cache": "f16, resident on the GPU for both engines", "model_load_included": false, "repeats": 3, "seq_lens": [128, 256, 512, 1024], "thread_policy": "per host_profile; identical for both engines within a run. On a fully offloaded run CPU threads only drive dispatch and sampling; they are fixed anyway so a cell states its whole configuration.", "thread_polling": "active", "warmup": "one discarded engine-native warmup before each measured test"}}, "protocol_sha256": "127892fd1cb9e8b3921a6444fe8a6523eed27063d1916c98ee6dd75e0af0dc65", "runner": {"commit": "fa6660490392f795ccb1def0d2e728c05387e997", "path": "tools/bench_cross_engine.py", "sha256": "cddda5ec2d5ce7b5f8753d48a778492dfdb400ecd00ab813d4ac1c7dd79cc308"}, "schema": "geist.benchmark.cross-engine-run.v1", "system": {"compiler": "Apple clang version 21.0.0 (clang-2100.4.1.1)", "cpu": "Apple M1 Max", "logical_cores": 10, "memory_bytes": "68719476736", "os": "Darwin 27.2.0", "performance_cores": "8", "product": "ProductName:\t\tmacOS\nProductVersion:\t\t27.2.1\nBuildVersion:\t\t26B131"}}
